## Project Description

This project contains practical programs based on HTML, CSS and JavaScript.

The project provides a main dashboard from which different practical program sections can be accessed.


## Project Sections

### HTML Programs

Total Programs: 15

The HTML section contains programs related to:
- HTML Fundamentals
- Lists
- Tables
- Images and Hyperlinks
- Forms
- Audio and Video
- Frames and Iframes
- Semantic Elements
- HTML5 Input Types
- CSS Styling
- Responsive Webpages
- Bootstrap
- Portfolio


